    "cover": "cg_cover",
    "rating": "teen",
    "source": "ECHO.md",
    "description": "A near-future where an invisible system understands everyone too well. You were one of its maintainers — until a grainy 1999 photograph flags you as a Potential Anomaly. Pulled between the Order, Chaos, and Shelter protocols, you learn the ECHO Project's real aim: to find a human consciousness that, even after being fully understood, can still say 'no.' Four fates; one refusal to be defined. English-first cut, with a full Simplified-Chinese track."
